      "requested": "claudeBudgetUsd 50 and perAttemptBudgetUsd 6",
      "status": "documentation-only",
      "note": "These are explicit ceilings. Nothing in the profile authorizes spend; a real run needs a logged-in CLI and a supervising decision."
    },
    {
      "field": "linuxEnforcementBackend",
